 R←Test_Dir_013(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;list;parms;buff;qdmx
⍝ Test the `Dir` method on a non-existent directory
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

 :Trap 6
     {}##.FilesAndDirs.Dir'This_should_not_exist_really/'
     →T.FailsIf 1
 :Else
     qdmx←⎕DMX
     →T.PassesIf'Directory does not exist'≡qdmx.EM
 :EndTrap

 R←T._OK
